        "header": "3UltraText Bench: Benchmark Design",
        "images": [
            {
                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2610.09823/2610.09823v1/Figures_3.png",
                "caption": "Figure 4:Task definition and evaluation protocol.The generator receives only promptpp.\nQ-Judger, from Qwen-Image-Bench(Li et al., 2026a), applies the UltraText rubric to the image and complete referenceRR, returning six image-level scores that map to four reporting dimensions and a composite.\nReference fields and scores are not paired one-to-one. Grid cells give coarse locations; regions may share a cell.\nInvalid responses remain unscored and reduce coverage.\nThe bakery schematic simplifies the four-region recordA1_L1_EN_001, reproduced inAppendixB.1.",
                "position": 855
            }
        ]
